    mc "对了，我已经把我们的行李都送到我们中间要暂停的地方了，所以路上什么也不用带。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1049
translate chinese skypause2_b1ba66c2:

    # a "Thanks, [mc]. That's convenient."
    a "谢谢，[mc!t]。这样会轻松不少。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1053
translate chinese skypause2_458803a3:

    # mc "Man... They sure took their sweet time!"
    mc "天啊……可算是来了！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1057
translate chinese skypause2_ce81d7f3:

    # f "Yooow~!"
    f "哟~~！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1058
translate chinese skypause2_0810df17:

    # m "Sorry we're late. She had trouble choosing a swimsuit."
    m "抱歉我们迟到了。她挑泳衣挑了很久。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1059
translate chinese skypause2_78d7a2d1:

    # s "Hey, our bet is still on, right?"
    s "我们的打赌还算数，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1060
translate chinese skypause2_5a2859d5:

    # f "Of course!"
    f "那当然！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1061
translate chinese skypause2_cfdad68e:

    # yt "Whatever that bet is, I hope it doesn't involve me at all..."
    yt "不管是什么打赌，希望都跟我没有任何关系……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1064
translate chinese skypause2_131f6e5e:

    # mc "So, aren't you coming with us?"
    mc "你不和我们一起吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1067
translate chinese skypause2_4d0b5cb7:

    # cl "Thank you for inviting me."
    cl "谢谢你邀请我。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1068
translate chinese skypause2_d70b2d2a:

    # cl "But I don't deserve such joyous occasions in my life any longer. That said, please enjoy your time."
    cl "但我的人生已经不配再有这种欢乐时光了。所以请你们尽情享受吧。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1069
translate chinese skypause2_3f89d5dd:

    # m "I told you."
    m "我就说嘛。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1070
translate chinese skypause2_9909ec91:

    # mc "Oh well... that's a bummer to hear. Thanks for bringing them here, in any case."
    mc "好吧……有点遗憾。不管怎样，还是感谢你把她们送来。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1073
translate chinese skypause2_0f284fe1:

    # cl "My pleasure. I'll be going now."
    cl "这是我该做的。我先告辞了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1074
translate chinese skypause2_5ce09775:

    # mc "Mhm."
    mc "嗯。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1081
translate chinese skypause2_d292ce69:

    # mc "Most of us know you already, but please introduce yourself to everyone."
    mc "我们大部分人都已经认识你了，但请你还是做一下自我介绍吧。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1084
translate chinese skypause2_60cc0125:

    # m "Hello everyone, my name is Moon Chi. I'm already twenty-four years old, but I'm still studying at Drealerra Academy."
    m "大家好，我叫气月。我已经24岁了，但我还在德列拉学院上学。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1085
translate chinese skypause2_3a4a7db3:

    # m "Nice to meet you guys."
    m "很高兴认识你们。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1088
translate chinese skypause2_08e33d1e:

    # mc "Wait a minute, you're older than me?"
    mc "等等啊，你比我还大？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1089
translate chinese skypause2_593cf11b:

    # m "How old are you?"
    m "你多大？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1090
translate chinese skypause2_54791067:

    # mc "I'm twenty-three."
    mc "我23岁。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1091
translate chinese skypause2_fb742220:

    # m "Oh, well then, yeah. I'm older than you."
    m "哦，那确实，我比你大。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1092
translate chinese skypause2_1f10569b:

    # m "Anyway, should I tell them?"
    m "总之，要告诉她们吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1093
translate chinese skypause2_af9b6077:

    # mc "It's not something we should hide, so go ahead."
    mc "也不是什么应该瞒着的事，你就说吧。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1098
translate chinese skypause2_03f89b9f:

    # m "Well, I am [mc]'s servant."
    m "好吧，我是[mc!t]的仆人。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1101
translate chinese skypause2_3928a113:

    # "......."
    "……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1102
translate chinese skypause2_cea28e34:

    # "..........."
    "…………"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1108
translate chinese skypause2_53880b72:

    # e "Whaaaat?!"
    e "什么？？？？！！！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1110
translate chinese skypause2_2ccb5ae1:

    # a "[mc], what are you thinking?! Don't you realize that-"
    a "[mc!t]，你干什么啊？！你难道不知道这——"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1112
translate chinese skypause2_4be5b0f1:

    # e "You just released me from my shackles, and now you're-"
    e "你才刚刚把我救出来，现在却又——"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1115
translate chinese skypause2_e964a0f3:

    # g "Heeeeh..."
    g "哈哈……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1118
translate chinese skypause2_ed8700f2:

    # mc "Stop, stop, stop!"
    mc "停，停，停！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1119
translate chinese skypause2_2d977fe5:

    # mc "It is not what you think!"
    mc "不是你们想的那样的！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1120
translate chinese skypause2_ebb1d84e:

    # a "Explain!"
    a "给我解释清楚！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1123
translate chinese skypause2_c3e97dd6:

    # mc "Well... She's more like a bodyguard than a servant. There's much more flexibility than Emma used to have."
    mc "这个……她与其说是仆人，更像是保镖。比艾玛之前那种处境要自由得多。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1124
translate chinese skypause2_2b52ad78:

    # mc "She won't be sticking with me all the time."
    mc "她不会一直跟着我。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1127
translate chinese skypause2_96a03557:

    # mc "She also has the freedom to choose what she wants to do, am I right?"
    mc "她也完全有自由做自己想做的事，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1128
translate chinese skypause2_8cb62253:

    # m "Yes."
    m "是的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1129
translate chinese skypause2_d4cd93fd:

    # mc "See?"
    mc "听见了没？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1130
translate chinese skypause2_8dd4a03a:

    # mc "I also thought we could take her whenever we have some investigations to do as well, Em."
    mc "我还想着，在调查的时候可以带上她一起，小艾。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1133
translate chinese skypause2_3388a208:

    # e "Oh..."
    e "噢……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1134
translate chinese skypause2_b7c61dcb:

    # mc "The more brains working on it, the better, right? I mean, I won't let you do it all by yourself, you know?"
    mc "能出主意的人越多越好嘛，对吧？我可不会把活儿都交给你来干。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1135
translate chinese skypause2_5a1af161:

    # e "You have a point."
    e "你说得有道理。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1136
translate chinese skypause2_16017a43:

    # e "Although, I have a question..."
    e "但是，我有一个问题……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1139
translate chinese skypause2_aa928edb:

    # e "I'm no extraordinary person, so please don't take any offense. But what can you do to help us?"
    e "我自己也不是什么很有能力的人，所以我无意冒犯你。不过你究竟在哪里能帮上我们呢？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1140
translate chinese skypause2_7ba864da:

    # mc "Em... Please don't start a fight."
    mc "小艾……火药味别这么足。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1141
translate chinese skypause2_4d40d245:

    # e "I'm just asking her, [mc]. What's wrong with that?"
    e "我只是问问她，[mc!t]。这有什么的？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1145
translate chinese skypause2_6be65412:

    # m "......"
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1152
translate chinese skypause2_1df961c1:

    # e "*shivers*"
    e "*发抖*"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1155
translate chinese skypause2_eb538ade:

    # e "*stepping backward*"
    e "*退后*"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1158
translate chinese skypause2_f1f18eae:

    # m "Mafias..."
    m "黑手党也好……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1159
translate chinese skypause2_41edfbbf:

    # m "Assassins..."
    m "刺客也好……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1160
translate chinese skypause2_448a8e7e:

    # m "I know all about them."
    m "他们的事我全都知道。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1163
translate chinese skypause2_3bc75161:

    # mc "Hey, Moon? Don't fight, okay? Just chill."
    mc "月，别生气，好吧？冷静点。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1164
translate chinese skypause2_5c515786:

    # m "And if you are from this generation, you probably know about the war between Sha Crea and Glabia territories."
    m "你是这一代出生的，应该知道沙克雷亚和格拉比亚之间的战争吧。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1167
translate chinese skypause2_66e6963b:

    # k "If I remember correctly, it was a fight to overtake the other's territory, am I right?"
    k "我没记错的话，战争的目的是为了完全吞并对方，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1170
translate chinese skypause2_e535137f:

    # m "Yes, and I became one of Glabia's military puppets when I reached 12 years old."
    m "是的，我在12岁的时候就被格拉比亚抓去充军了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1171
translate chinese skypause2_2beb5bd0:

    # k "My god..."
    k "我的天……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1172
translate chinese skypause2_65b7999c:

    # k "Dear, how... How did you-"
    k "亲爱的，你……你是怎么——"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1173
translate chinese skypause2_2896111f:

    # m "Let's leave it at that."
    m "这个就先不提了吧。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1176
translate chinese skypause2_21cac7d7:

    # mc "*whispers* Uhh... what is it, [landlady]?"
    mc "*低语* 呃……什么情况啊，[landlady!t]？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1177
translate chinese skypause2_c13fe75c:

    # k "*whispers* I can't tell you about it without disrespecting her, [mc]."
    k "*低语* 我没法用能给她足够的尊重的语言把事情解释给你，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1178
translate chinese skypause2_df31272c:

    # mc "*whispers* I see..."
    mc "*低语* 我明白了……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1181
translate chinese skypause2_9928b43f:

    # k "*whispers* But she shouldn't be here. How did she... get out of that place?"
    k "*低语* 但她不应该出现在这的。她到底……是怎么逃出来的？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1182
translate chinese skypause2_5435a9e3:

    # k "*whispers* Just take care of her, [mc]. That's all I can ask."
    k "*低语* 你要好好照顾她，[mc!t]。我只能说这么多了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1185
translate chinese skypause2_272aa5d5:

    # m "I was there fighting for my life while you all had these dramatic personal issues."
    m "你们几个在纠结情感问题的时候，我在那里为了活命，不断杀人、战斗。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1187
translate chinese skypause2_4e515625:

    # g "Hey, isn't that going a bit too far for someone we barely even know?"
    g "喂，我们又不认识你，说这种话有点过分了吧？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1188
translate chinese skypause2_139266d5:

    # mc "That's the truth, Gwen. You know it yourself."
    mc "她说的是事实，格温。你也知道。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1191
translate chinese skypause2_20340416_1:

    # g "......"
    g "……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1194
translate chinese skypause2_66a57637:

    # m "I can assure you that you have no reason to doubt my skills."
    m "我可以保证，你不用担心我的能力。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1195
translate chinese skypause2_e082e0cd:

    # m "But if you're going to ask me with that tone of voice, I'm sorry, but I'm going to show you my other side because I don't like it."
    m "但既然你用这种语气问我，那很抱歉，我就要给你看看我的另一面了，因为我不喜欢你那样。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1196
translate chinese skypause2_1c6ce3ee:

    # m "Even if you told me not to take offense, I know what's hidden within that sentence. I am not a kid, Emma."
    m "即使你说了无意冒犯，我也知道那句话的隐藏含义。我不是小孩子，艾玛。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1197
translate chinese skypause2_ae3e873c:

    # m "So, what's it going to be?"
    m "所以，你怎么说？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1210
translate chinese skypause2_8ed139ad:

    # mc "I think I should-"
    mc "我觉得我得——"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1212
translate chinese skypause2_ff9e8a15:

    # k "Let them be. She's trying to make Emma understand."
    k "不用管她们。她在让艾玛理解。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1213
translate chinese skypause2_e0715dbc:

    # mc "But-"
    mc "但是——"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1214
translate chinese skypause2_14460234:

    # k "Just watch."
    k "看着就好。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1215
translate chinese skypause2_b8fa316c:

    # k "Both their personalities will eventually collide with each other. I think Moon knows that."
    k "她们两个的性格总会发生摩擦的。我觉得月也知道。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1216
translate chinese skypause2_ee35abda:

    # k "If they want to understand each other, they have to do it now."
    k "如果她们想互相理解，就必须现在就做。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1217
translate chinese skypause2_2265aa9f:

    # mc "They can just talk about it, you know?"
    mc "她们完全可以谈谈就好的，你知道吧？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1218
translate chinese skypause2_119629b0:

    # k "What do you expect from someone who went through military training, [mc]?"
    k "你觉得一个当过兵的人还能怎么做呢，[mc!t]？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1221
translate chinese skypause2_cc18594e:

    # m "A nice, solid punch to be expected from a Mafia servant."
    m "结实有力的一拳，不愧是黑手党的成员。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1224
translate chinese skypause2_010d00e4:

    # e "Ah."
    e "啊。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1227
translate chinese skypause2_faaffefe:

    # m "I see you're good at hiding your emotion. That's nice. It makes you unpredictable. But that won't work on me."
    m "我看出来你很擅长掩饰自己的情绪。不错。这样会让你难以预测。但对我不起作用。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1230
translate chinese skypause2_a52f7f94:

    # m "Now my question to you, dear childhood friend..."
    m "现在轮到我问你了，亲爱的“青梅竹马”……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1231
translate chinese skypause2_ad6e165b:

    # e "......"
    e "……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1234
translate chinese skypause2_27ec9cb9:

    # m "Would you take a bullet to save him?"
    m "你愿意为他挡子弹吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1235
translate chinese skypause2_06bddfcf:

    # m "You and I are the same, so whatever your answer is, that would be mine."
    m "你和我是一样的，所以不管你的答案是什么，那也都会是我的答案。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1236
translate chinese skypause2_846bac63:

    # m "The only difference between us is that I have nowhere else to go."
    m "我们之间唯一的区别就是我没有其他可以去的地方了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1237
translate chinese skypause2_4e6e6e57:

    # e "Yes. I would without thinking twice."
    e "我愿意。我会毫不犹豫地为他去死。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1240
translate chinese skypause2_d0a5cc2b:

    # m "Good~!"
    m "很好~！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1243
translate chinese skypause2_e630b282:

    # m "Then it's a pleasure to be working with you!"
    m "那和你共事肯定会很愉快的！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1244
translate chinese skypause2_2838f70c:

    # e "Mhm."
    e "嗯。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1248
translate chinese skypause2_1e1f511f:

    # k "That's... very cruel."
    k "这可……真残忍。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1249
translate chinese skypause2_582359ea_1:

    # mc "Hm?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1254
translate chinese skypause2_b5ff1a1f:

    # m "I apologize for shattering the mood."
    m "抱歉，坏了气氛。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1257
translate chinese skypause2_4cd960d7:

    # m "I just wanted to make myself clear."
    m "我只想把我的意思表达清楚。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1258
translate chinese skypause2_ca6f1e3a:

    # k "Not a problem, dear. As long as you two understand each other."
    k "没关系，亲爱的。只要你们俩能互相理解就好。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1261
translate chinese skypause2_f3485509:

    # shu "Wait, I would catch a bullet for Papa [mc] too!"
    shu "等等，我也愿意为[mc!t]哥哥挡子弹！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1263
translate chinese skypause2_9a2557b8:

    # shu "Pew, pew~!"
    shu "Biu Biu~！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1266
translate chinese skypause2_a66dd278:

    # mc "Not you. That would be too underwhelming."
    mc "滚一边去。那我宁愿被打死。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1267
translate chinese skypause2_031c0642:

    # shu "Ass."
    shu "贱人。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1268
translate chinese skypause2_e4d6b90f:

    # mc "Heh. Love you too, buddy."
    mc "哈。我也爱你，伙计。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1271
translate chinese skypause2_7a685e96:

    # mc "Alright, folks! It's time to go!"
    mc "好了，大伙！该出发了！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1272
translate chinese skypause2_29cc5e1e:

    # g "I'll get my baby real quick!"
    g "我马上去开我的车！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1273
translate chinese skypause2_99f43b11:

    # shu "There's nine of us, and my van only has seven seats, including me, the driver. So one has to ride along with Gwen."
    shu "我们有九个人，我的车带上驾驶座也只有七个座位。所以有个人要跟格温一起。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1274
translate chinese skypause2_59061b44:

    # g "I'll take [mc], no problemo! Let's go, let's go!"
    g "我带着[mc!t]一起，没问题！快走吧快走吧！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1284
translate chinese skypause2_6046360b:

    # f "This place looks hella shady. Are you sure this is where we should be?"
    f "这地方看起来好偏僻啊。确定是要来这里吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1285
translate chinese skypause2_8a03f9a3:

    # shu "One hundred percent!"
    shu "百分百确定！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1286
translate chinese skypause2_b8513f07:

    # mc "This here is a small harbor given to him by his parents, apparently."
    mc "这座小港口是他父母送给他的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1287
translate chinese skypause2_f1887ebb:

    # mc "He took me here a long time ago."
    mc "他很久之前带我来过。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1288
translate chinese skypause2_d5419aa6:

    # shu "Correct!"
    shu "没错！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:1289
translate chinese skypause2_0b866e31:

    # shu "I think this is a better place to keep my yacht: more secluded and away from jealous eyes."
