translate chinese freyatitplay_9ff213a1:

    # a "{i}No, no, no! Why would I think that we're close anyway?!"
    a "{i}不不不！说到底我为什么会觉得我和他关系很好呢？！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:4957
translate chinese freyatitplay_91a13a08:

    # a "{i}Jeez... This is bad!"
    a "{i}天啊……不妙！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:4958
translate chinese freyatitplay_b5c8390a:

    # mc "Hm? Something bothering you?"
    mc "嗯？有烦心事吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:4959
translate chinese freyatitplay_89b858a2:

    # mc "If I'm too much of a pushover, I can just go home, you know? Just say the word."
    mc "要是我太过头了，我可以直接走人的哦？你只用跟我说一声就好了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:4962
translate chinese freyatitplay_d257fb0b:

    # a "Don't make me feel bad~!"
    a "那我会很内疚的~！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:4963
translate chinese freyatitplay_ecfef0ea:

    # a "You haven't bought your school supplies yet, have you?!"
    a "你还没有买在学校里要用的东西，对吧？！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:4964
translate chinese freyatitplay_f13ae6c4:

    # mc "Uhh... No, not yet."
    mc "呃……是啊，还没买。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:4967
translate chinese freyatitplay_317a6f7c:

    # a "Come, let's go shopping!"
    a "来吧，我们去买东西！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:4968
translate chinese freyatitplay_c84348b7:

    # mc "A-are you taking me on a date...?"
    mc "你-你是要跟我约会吗……？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:4970
translate chinese freyatitplay_0178a781:

    # a "It. Is. Not."
    a "这。不。是。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:4971
translate chinese freyatitplay_368dc748:

    # a "A DATE~!" with hpunch
    a "约会~！" with hpunch

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:4974
translate chinese freyatitplay_1f61be12:

    # a "{i}God...! Why does he have to be so cute~?!"
    a "{i}天啊……！他为什么非要这么可爱~？！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:4975
translate chinese freyatitplay_31e978dd:

    # a "{i}Someone... anyone... please help me~!"
    a "{i}来人啊……有没有人……救救我~！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:4978
translate chinese freyatitplay_4e5af98c:

    # ff "Ahh... Quite remarkable, indeed..."
    ff "啊……实在是令人赞叹啊……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:4997
translate chinese freyatitplay_3d923a74:

    # mc "Hey, whatcha doing?"
    mc "你在干嘛呢？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:4998
translate chinese freyatitplay_1c8098d9:

    # a "Just preparing tags and bookmarks for my notebooks so I can be organized later on."
    a "在准备书签和标签，方便我之后做笔记。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:4999
translate chinese freyatitplay_6a27fdd5:

    # mc "Ah, I see..."
    mc "啊，好的……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5000
translate chinese freyatitplay_13f17bc6:

    # mc "You can use your laptop for taking notes, you know? They told me that in a short briefing after I enrolled."
    mc "为什么不直接用笔记本电脑呢？他们在我入学之后的一个短会上说可以用的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5001
translate chinese freyatitplay_b5608417:

    # a "Hmm... I could, yeah..."
    a "嗯……是可以……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5002
translate chinese freyatitplay_8bc46424:

    # a "But I prefer doing things the old way. I don't tend to go for convenience a lot, but rather, comfort."
    a "但我更喜欢用老办法。我不是太喜欢总是用最方便的东西，更喜欢用我觉得舒服的方式。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5003
translate chinese freyatitplay_8e27daa8:

    # mc "Okay...? That's probably the most interesting thing I've learned about you."
    mc "好吧……？这可能是你身上最有意思的地方了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5006
translate chinese freyatitplay_11dd9ceb:

    # a "How?"
    a "为什么？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5007
translate chinese freyatitplay_e0630222:

    # mc "Well, that kind of preference is rare these days."
    mc "这种习惯现在很少见了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5008
translate chinese freyatitplay_20813e84:

    # mc "Technology has been slowly but surely taking over the world, and people have been using it a lot now."
    mc "科技正在慢慢接管世界，人们全都在用。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5009
translate chinese freyatitplay_9fb673a3:

    # mc "And then, there's you."
    mc "但你却不一样。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5012
translate chinese freyatitplay_5c3e8027:

    # a "*giggles* If you put it that way, that's kinda funny."
    a "*笑* 你这么说的话，还挺有意思的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5013
translate chinese freyatitplay_ab62572a:

    # mc "Are you really busy? Because I wanted to ask you stuff about the Academy."
    mc "你忙吗？我想问你有关学校的事。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5017
translate chinese freyatitplay_0f1fe51c:

    # a "Actually, I'm already done."
    a "我其实已经弄完了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5018
translate chinese freyatitplay_4d0f4698:

    # a "What did you want to ask?"
    a "你想问什么？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5019
translate chinese freyatitplay_b78e5950:

    # mc "Well, maybe you can give me some tips? Especially with the teachers."
    mc "你能给我点建议吗？特别是有关老师们的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5020
translate chinese freyatitplay_8eca016f:

    # mc "You mentioned that kind ones are infrequent, so I could at least look out for them while it's early."
    mc "你也说了温柔的老师没几个，所以我想提前做好准备。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5023
translate chinese freyatitplay_b7d261be:

    # a "To be honest, aside from our advisor, I have no idea who our teachers are for the rest of the subjects."
    a "说实话，除了班主任之外，我不知道其他的老师都是谁。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5024
translate chinese freyatitplay_914156be:

    # a "They usually assign the teachers for each subject randomly every year, so there's no way to know who we'll get."
    a "每门课的老师在每年都会重新随机分配，所以不可能提前知道我们的老师都是谁的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5025
translate chinese freyatitplay_771d44ae:

    # a "Just be prepared and don't do anything stupid on the first day. Oh, and remember not to be late."
    a "只要做足准备，不要第一天就做傻事就好了。哦，还有，记得千万别迟到。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5028
translate chinese freyatitplay_c2ce79c5:

    # a "But I can tell you a few things that I do. Would that be helpful enough?"
    a "不过我可以告诉你几件我知道的事情。不知道会不会有帮助？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5029
translate chinese freyatitplay_edd3fa76:

    # mc "Yeah, please do! I will absolutely need it!"
    mc "当然，请说吧！我肯定会用得上的！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5032
translate chinese freyatitplay_e8d97e13:

    # a "First, to talk about the most annoying thing: that would be lunchtime."
    a "首先，就是最烦人的地方：就是午饭时间。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5033
translate chinese freyatitplay_726706e4:

    # a "As I've told you, there's a cafeteria inside the academy."
    a "我告诉过你，学校里有个食堂。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5034
translate chinese freyatitplay_a801911b:

    # a "If you could imagine what a train station is like during rush hour, that's what it's like during lunchtime."
    a "一到午饭的时候，那里面就跟高峰期的火车站一样。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5035
translate chinese freyatitplay_70e55f0b:

    # a "The cafeteria is tiny, but I admit that their food is good, so students are always fighting for it."
    a "食堂很小，但饭菜都很好吃，所以学生们都争着抢着去吃饭。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5036
translate chinese freyatitplay_9f4141e4:

    # a "You'll get pushed here, trampled there, so I suggest you just bring your own food for lunch."
    a "在里面会被推来挤去的，所以最好还是自备午饭吧。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5037
translate chinese freyatitplay_0a0c6dc5:

    # a "Either that, or you can also buy some food outside of the academy. We're allowed to go out for lunch, so..."
    a "或者，可以去学校外面买东西吃。午饭时间是可以出校的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5038
translate chinese freyatitplay_aec7b685:

    # a "The only problem is that the stores take quite a bit of walking to reach."
    a "问题是最近的商店也要走挺远。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5039
translate chinese freyatitplay_49673842:

    # mc "That's a pain in the ass, alright..."
    mc "这确实是个头疼的问题……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5040
translate chinese freyatitplay_82497ac7:

    # mc "I better tell Sky to cook for me."
    mc "我最好让斯凯给我做饭吃吧。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5043
translate chinese freyatitplay_3fef06fa:

    # a "Sky?"
    a "斯凯？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5044
translate chinese freyatitplay_44c92499:

    # mc "Ah, she's my [roommate]. She'd always bring lunch to school, so maybe I could ask her to double her portions. Haha!"
    mc "啊，她是我[roommate!t]。她一直都自己带午饭去学校的，所以我说不定能让她也给我做一份。哈哈！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5045
translate chinese freyatitplay_c15744ad:

    # a "Is she enrolled in Drealerra too?"
    a "她也在德列拉上学吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5046
translate chinese freyatitplay_f6056ada:

    # mc "Oh, nahh..."
    mc "不是的……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5047
translate chinese freyatitplay_4258a516:

    # mc "She's in an all-girls high school at the moment."
    mc "她在一个女校上学。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5048
translate chinese freyatitplay_ebe784a9:

    # a "I see..."
    a "我知道了……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5051
translate chinese freyatitplay_147e0f52:

    # a "Anyway, that's one thing for you to know."
    a "总之，刚才说的你要记住。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5052
translate chinese freyatitplay_2a3ce0b4:

    # a "Another is regarding tardiness."
    a "另一点就是不要拖拖拉拉的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5053
translate chinese freyatitplay_3c2a439b:

    # a "As I've told you, being late is heavily punished in the Academy."
    a "我也告诉过你，学院对迟到的惩罚很严重。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5054
translate chinese freyatitplay_a6678d92:

    # a "The question is, what kind of punishment?"
    a "问题是，到底是什么惩罚呢？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5055
translate chinese freyatitplay_0906aabc:

    # mc "Do you really have to make it suspenseful?"
    mc "有必要整这么悬疑吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5056
translate chinese freyatitplay_77117be4:

    # a "It's the good old Guidance Counseling..."
    a "答案就是，会被拉去进行我们每个人都最喜欢的指导谈话……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5057
translate chinese freyatitplay_a83381d1:

    # a "Not on the third, not on the second, but on your very first offense."
    a "不会到第三次才谈，也不是第二次就谈，而是在你第一次迟到的时候，就狠狠轰炸你。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5058
translate chinese freyatitplay_6b4d3956:

    # mc "Eek! A-already?!"
    mc "妈呀！这-这么狠？！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5059
translate chinese freyatitplay_876e3a78:

    # a "Unfortunately, yeah. They take it very seriously."
    a "是啊。他们把这事看得非常严重。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5060
translate chinese freyatitplay_a15214fb:

    # a "But that's how you know the core principle is good as they uphold and execute it flawlessly."
    a "但只有这样严格执行，才能让你明白学院的核心纪律有多重要。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5061
translate chinese freyatitplay_bc738bdd:

    # a "Last is the exams."
    a "最后，就是考试了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5062
translate chinese freyatitplay_d6a9ed93:

    # mc "Uhh... What's with the exams? You're scaring me already."
    mc "呃……考试有什么特别的吗？你已经吓到我了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5063
translate chinese freyatitplay_f71c9a01:

    # a "Oh, no, no!"
    a "哦，没有，没有！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5064
translate chinese freyatitplay_aa1bf3cb:

    # a "They're also strict when it comes to it, but it's nothing like what they do when you are late."
    a "学院对考试当然也很严格，但跟迟到完全不是一回事。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5065
translate chinese freyatitplay_f0a3099f:

    # a "I know most schools do written exams, but here, we do it through a computer."
    a "我知道大多数学校都是进行笔试的，但我们这里，都是上机考试。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5066
translate chinese freyatitplay_4f694aaf:

    # a "We have a separate room called the 'Exam Laboratory', which gets used during exams and only during exams."
    a "我们有个叫“考试实验室”的房间，只有在考试的时候才会用。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5067
translate chinese freyatitplay_6ab34b6d:

    # a "They have a very high-security system that prevents students cheating."
    a "有非常先进的系统防止学生作弊。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5068
translate chinese freyatitplay_2239ac3e:

    # a "So if you're thinking of doing it, you should reconsider."
    a "所以要是有那种念头的话，趁早放弃吧。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5069
translate chinese freyatitplay_59173a3a:

    # mc "That sounds pretty intense! What kind of academy is this?!"
    mc "听起来好吓人啊！这到底是什么学校啊？！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5072
translate chinese freyatitplay_3147b56c:

    # a "*giggles* Right~? They don't call it 'Prestigious' for nothing, after all."
    a "*笑* 对吧~？这里可不是白白被人叫“贵族”学校的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5073
translate chinese freyatitplay_df32ac7e:

    # a "At the end of the day, the students come out well-disciplined and educated."
    a "到最后呢，这里的学生毕业的时候全都纪律严明，成绩优秀。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5074
translate chinese freyatitplay_42d5dd85:

    # mc "Let me guess, you're a top student, aren't you?"
    mc "我猜猜，你是个优等生吧？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5075
translate chinese freyatitplay_ab5716c1:

    # a "Yeah! Not at the very top, but I'm one of the top students in our second year!"
    a "是啊！虽然不是第一名，但我在第二学年的成绩还是在班里名列前茅的！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5076
translate chinese freyatitplay_cae7b7eb:

    # mc "Man... You're pretty smart! No regular student would have this attention to detail, either!"
    mc "天啊……你真聪明！普通学生也不会注意到这么多细节的！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5079
translate chinese freyatitplay_2dadcb07:

    # a "*blushes* T-thanks... But those are just my observations, nothing more..."
    a "*脸红* 谢-谢谢……但是这些也只是我观察到的而已……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5080
translate chinese freyatitplay_988309b7:

    # mc "Still, you're-"
    mc "尽管如此，你仍然——"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5081
translate chinese freyatitplay_66b113df:

    # mc "Wait, are you blushing?!"
    mc "哎哟，你脸红啦？！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5083
translate chinese freyatitplay_72c8c987:

    # a "I am not~!"
    a "我没有~！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5084
translate chinese freyatitplay_218be88d:

    # mc "Why do you always deny things? Your camera is clear enough for me to see, you know?"
    mc "你怎么总是爱不承认呢？我通过屏幕看得很清楚啊。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5087
translate chinese freyatitplay_ca674865:

    # a "W-well... No one has actually complimented me directly like that. So, I guess I just appreciated it more than I thought I would."
    a "没-没……没人这么直接地夸过我。所以，我可能就是有点太高兴了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5088
translate chinese freyatitplay_ab12ebc5:

    # mc "Really? Doesn't your mom ever compliment you?"
    mc "真的吗？你妈妈都不会夸你的吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5089
translate chinese freyatitplay_54a52fa2:

    # a "She used to..."
    a "她以前会的……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5090
translate chinese freyatitplay_8fea2db2:

    # mc "Hmm..."
    mc "嗯……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5093
translate chinese freyatitplay_e9b4dc40:

    # a "{i}I don't want to admit it at first, but I'm slowly starting to care for him..."
    a "{i}我一开始不想承认，但我慢慢开始在意他了……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5094
translate chinese freyatitplay_6913b2c0:

    # a "{i}He's unlike the other people mother has told me to do something about..."
    a "{i}他跟以前那些妈妈让我接近的人都不一样……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5095
translate chinese freyatitplay_c528720e:

    # a "{i}All they ever did was talk about themselves and what they wanted. Nobody else cared about what I thought. At least, not until him."
    a "{i}他们只会说他们自己的事，还有他们想要什么。没人关心我怎么想。但他不一样。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5096
translate chinese freyatitplay_4298cddf:

    # a "{i}He may be annoying half the time, but he's a nice person..."
    a "{i}他超过一半的时间都很烦人，但他是个好人……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5097
translate chinese freyatitplay_66f2a75f:

    # a "{i}Others would always try and make a move on me at this point, but he never did that..."
    a "{i}其他的人这个时候都已经开始打我的主意了，但他却根本没有这个意思……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5098
translate chinese freyatitplay_5e7f02f0:

    # a "{i}This is so unfair~!"
    a "{i}这也太不公平了~！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5101
translate chinese freyatitplay_34278cfd:

    # f "Hey, sis! Are you free? Can you check this-"
    f "嘿，姐！有时间吗？可不可以——"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5102
translate chinese freyatitplay_5e7fff99:

    # a "Not now, Freya! I'm busy studying!"
    a "现在不行，芙蕾雅！我在学习呢！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5103
translate chinese freyatitplay_5d2fdb6c:

    # f "But-"
    f "但是——"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5104
translate chinese freyatitplay_221857b2:

    # a "I'll check it tomorrow as soon as I wake up, I promise!"
    a "我明天一起床就给你看，我保证！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5107
translate chinese freyatitplay_84e11bd0:

    # f "Okay~! Thanks, sis!"
    f "好的~！谢谢姐姐！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5108
translate chinese freyatitplay_7ebe248a:

    # a "You should go to sleep now! It's getting late!"
    a "你该去睡觉了！不早了！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5109
translate chinese freyatitplay_82be4dd2:

    # f "Yeah, yeah, I will!"
    f "好的好的，我马上睡！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5112
translate chinese freyatitplay_6cba97dc:

    # mc "You cooked up that reason pretty well... I love it! Like, it's as if it's even the school year yet! Ahahahaaa!"
    mc "你这借口编得可真好……我喜欢！毕竟，现在还没开学呢！哈哈哈哈哈哈！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5113
translate chinese freyatitplay_b18c9eff:

    # a "Well, I don't want her to know I'm talking to a guy. She'll make fun of me."
    a "我不想让她知道我在跟男生说话。她会笑我的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5114
translate chinese freyatitplay_be4c419f:

    # mc "Hey, you're pretty! There's nothing wrong with that!"
    mc "哎，你很漂亮啊！这有什么不好的！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5117
translate chinese freyatitplay_4d6b9ea2:

    # a "*blushes*"
    a "*脸红*"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:5118
translate chinese freyatitplay_e49cd138:

    # mc "Try and deny that again. I dare you!"
