translate chinese freyatitplay_853af029:

    # yt "It seems that she loves doing this, but I sure did not ask for this part of her service!"
    yt "看来她喜欢这么做，但我可没让她提供过这种服务！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6743
translate chinese freyatitplay_664d7736:

    # yt "Also, I don't know what her intentions by doing this, so let's just observe for now."
    yt "不过，我不知道她为什么要这样，所以现在还是先观察吧。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6746
translate chinese freyatitplay_5dfca1a8:

    # yt "Hell, I'm not complaining, though..."
    yt "倒也不是说我在抱怨……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6749
translate chinese freyatitplay_fe582cc7:

    # mc "Well, you're not {b}that{/b} weird. Your partner was way worse."
    mc "呃，你倒没有{b}那么{/b}怪。你的搭档要怪得多。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6750
translate chinese freyatitplay_d93acf6c:

    # m "Who? Owl?"
    m "谁？枭吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6751
translate chinese freyatitplay_b1f0d7e4:

    # m "Yeah, she's been through a lot and has a lot of loose screws too."
    m "是啊，她经历过很多，脾气也大得很。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6752
translate chinese freyatitplay_cb696712:

    # mc "Haha! You guys are not afraid of anything, are you?"
    mc "哈哈！你们俩都是天不怕地不怕的主，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6755
translate chinese freyatitplay_b0fcfb64:

    # m "Well, chickens are pretty creepy."
    m "嗯，鸡倒是挺吓人的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6756
translate chinese freyatitplay_c4532ac8:

    # mc "Wait, what? Come on... I bet you eat a lot of them."
    mc "等等，什么？拜托……你肯定吃过不少吧。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6757
translate chinese freyatitplay_ac4172ab:

    # m "When they're golden and crispy, yeah."
    m "那也是它们变得金黄、酥脆之后的事了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6758
translate chinese freyatitplay_2fe0ac1e:

    # mc "Got anything else?"
    mc "还有别的吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6761
translate chinese freyatitplay_6be65412_2:

    # m "......"
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6780
translate chinese freyatitplay_6be65412_3:

    # m "......"
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6781
translate chinese freyatitplay_3fa72ca6:

    # m "...Being by myself?"
    m "……孤独？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6782
translate chinese freyatitplay_97593b6b:

    # mc "Oh...?"
    mc "哦……？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6783
translate chinese freyatitplay_0eb670a5:

    # m "I'm scared of ending up alone."
    m "我很怕自己一个人。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6784
translate chinese freyatitplay_74f85bbc:

    # m "There were times that... I would curl up in a corner and pray that someone would come."
    m "有时候……我会蜷缩在角落里，祈祷着会有人来找我。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6787
translate chinese freyatitplay_dc09fa5b:

    # yt "So she wasn't sleeping that time?"
    yt "所以她那时候不是在睡觉吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6790
translate chinese freyatitplay_835e6b2e:

    # m "Since I was born, you were the only one who came."
    m "从我出生以来，你是唯一一个来找我的人。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6791
translate chinese freyatitplay_7293fa5a:

    # m "Do you know how I felt when I heard your voice?"
    m "你知道我听见你的声音的时候，是什么感觉吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6792
translate chinese freyatitplay_0932bce3:

    # mc "Tell me."
    mc "跟我说说。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6793
translate chinese freyatitplay_a96890c5:

    # m "I was filled with anxiety."
    m "我心里充满了焦虑和不安。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6794
translate chinese freyatitplay_69fb21f6:

    # mc "Huh? Why?"
    mc "啊？为什么？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6795
translate chinese freyatitplay_67b9a68f:

    # m "Because for the first time, someone came to me when I told myself that it was going to be the last time I pray."
    m "我当时告诉自己，这是我最后一次祈祷了。然而，却第一次真的有人来了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6796
translate chinese freyatitplay_6321972d:

    # m "I don't know if that was fate or a curse."
    m "我不知道这究竟是命运，还是诅咒。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6797
translate chinese freyatitplay_0f56a016:

    # m "I don't know the possibilities. I don't know what will happen in the future."
    m "我不知道这之中的可能性。我不知道未来会发生什么。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6798
translate chinese freyatitplay_e50bc361:

    # m "Because in my whole life, I was considered a curse. I was thrown away for that same reason."
    m "因为我这一辈子，都被人当做是诅咒。我就是因为这个被抛弃的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6799
translate chinese freyatitplay_1ac69e42:

    # m "And I was afraid that it could happen again..."
    m "我害怕同样的事情会再次发生……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6800
translate chinese freyatitplay_b458e3de:

    # mc "Man... What have you been through? I saw that scar on your back earlier, and-"
    mc "天啊……你都经历过些什么啊？我之前看到你背上的伤疤了，然后——"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6802
translate chinese freyatitplay_21d1f14f:

    # m "Oh, you don't want to know."
    m "噢，这个你是绝对不会想知道的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6803
translate chinese freyatitplay_bd4065fc:

    # mc "Okay... I won't push you any further."
    mc "好吧……那我不继续问了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6806
translate chinese freyatitplay_59300e8a:

    # mc "Anyway, dinner is almost ready. You should go to the campfire now."
    mc "总之，晚饭快做好了。你也去篝火那边吧。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6807
translate chinese freyatitplay_4ff38512:

    # m "You go ahead. I want to enjoy some peace for now."
    m "你先去吧。我想再待一会儿。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6808
translate chinese freyatitplay_72a29623:

    # mc "Hm... Aren't you scared of being alone?"
    mc "嗯……你不是害怕一个人待着吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6809
translate chinese freyatitplay_2ee040ec:

    # m "Everyone is here, and you're here. I'm not scared of anything."
    m "大家都在，你也在。我什么都不怕。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6810
translate chinese freyatitplay_1a60c6a2:

    # mc "You can protect yourself better than I can, you know?"
    mc "你保护自己的本事可比我厉害多了，知道吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6811
translate chinese freyatitplay_373eaf65:

    # m "Oh, I know. It's just your presence that reassures me, nothing more."
    m "噢，我知道。只是你在这，我就很安心，仅此而已。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6812
translate chinese freyatitplay_cfce055e:

    # mc "Are you sure?"
    mc "你确定吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6813
translate chinese freyatitplay_310c7bb5:

    # m "Yeah. Go on. Do what you gotta do."
    m "是啊。走吧。去忙你的吧。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6816
translate chinese freyatitplay_a49ed4f8:

    # mc "Okay."
    mc "好。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6817
translate chinese freyatitplay_98e4f14a:

    # mc "I'll call out the others. Be sure to catch up."
    mc "我去叫其他人了。别被落下了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6818
translate chinese freyatitplay_adc759fb:

    # mc "We're roasting some meat and might have some of that chicken you're afraid of."
    mc "我们要烤肉，说不定还要吃你很怕的鸡呢。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6819
translate chinese freyatitplay_bf48e0f2:

    # m "I'll be there."
    m "我会去的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6834
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_007f5f24:

    # yt "Huh?"
    yt "啊？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6842
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_6a0da519:

    # yt "Sweet Mother Mary... I have seen the Light of the Moon..."
    yt "圣母玛利亚啊……这是……何等美妙的月色……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6843
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_92d504c7:

    # yt "Not a big fan of salt, my ass..."
    yt "还说什么不喜欢盐，净瞎扯……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6846
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_af7f2bb0:

    # yt "Shit, I want to join her, but I need to get this dinner ready!"
    yt "操，真想跟她一起，但我还得去做晚饭！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6847
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_97534606:

    # yt "Urrhh...! Curse you dinner!"
    yt "可恶啊……！晚饭，我操你妈！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6850
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_6be65412:

    # m "......"
    m "……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6853
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_db243b68:

    # m "Oops!"
    m "哎呀，不小心走光了！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6859
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_7381ef9f:

    # m "Or maybe not."
    m "逗你的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6860
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_c61f3380:

    # yt "Good Lord...! Look at those nipples!"
    yt "我的天啊……！瞧瞧这乳头！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6861
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_ddd9ae84:

    # yt "Jesus, she's breathtaking! I can't even say a word right now! I'm just... stunned!"
    yt "乖乖，实在太漂亮了！我现在连话都说不出来了！我整个……呆住了！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6862
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_4fb1b274:

    # m "Are you sure you want to stand there ogling me while dinner is waiting?"
    m "晚饭还等着呢，一直这么色眯眯地盯着我看没问题吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6863
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_d2f16adc:

    # m "By dinner, I mean, not me."
    m "想要得不得了了吧？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6864
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_dfd81e46:

    # mc "Uhh..."
    mc "呃……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6865
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_dbf63d8c:

    # m "That took your breath away, huh?"
    m "我是说晚饭，不是我。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6868
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_91a51592:

    # m "*chuckles* Go on. That's enough for your eyes today."
    m "*笑* 快走吧。今天给你看得够多了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6869
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_9d3b367a:

    # m "I might show you more next time. Who knows?"
    m "说不定下次我会让你再多看点。谁知道呢？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6870
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_b68ffd68:

    # m "Thanks for talking to me. I needed that."
    m "谢谢你跟我聊天。我很高兴。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6873
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_e769377c:

    # yt "Yeah, she's a fun one, alright. I should talk to her more, then."
    yt "她可真是有意思。那我应该多跟她聊聊。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6874
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_eb069a35:

    # yt "It looks like I'm going to enjoy her... {b}company{/b}."
    yt "看来我会很享受她的……{b}陪伴{/b}。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6891
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_0296c506:

    # k "*sighs* How nice would it be if things could stay like this forever?"
    k "*叹气* 要是能一直过这样的日子，该有多好？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6894
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_470f99be:

    # mc "Well, have faith and stay positive, and they eventually will. Maybe before you even know."
    mc "保持信心，乐观点，事情总会好起来的。说不定明天就能过上好日子呢。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6895
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_2ceb575b:

    # k "I admire your optimism, [mc]. I hope your words come true."
    k "我欣赏你的乐观，[mc!t]。希望你说的话可以成真。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6896
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_8dfafadf:

    # mc "[landlady], if you're that worried, why not let off some steam and join the others?"
    mc "[landlady!t]，你要是这么担心的话，要不就跟他们一起玩玩，放松一下？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6897
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_07fc69b9:

    # k "Me? Oh god... I'm too old to dance, [mc]."
    k "我？老天啊……我太老了，跳不动了，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6900
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_8c99c1f9:

    # mc "Is that even a thing? Nobody's ever too old to let loose!"
    mc "哪有这种说法？再老也能疯一把！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6903
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_2610404d:

    # mc "*whispers*"
    mc "*低语*"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6904
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_468b13d9:

    # shu "......"
    shu "……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6907
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_1132a28d:

    # shu "*whispers* I got you!"
    shu "*低语* 得嘞！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6910
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_892c0b4c:

    # mc "Alright, come with me!"
    mc "好了，跟我来！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6911
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_e4c8fd93:

    # k "Oh, wait! Wait! I told you I'm-"
    k "噢，等等！等等！我说了我——"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6920
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_0f6a6e7d:

    # shu "Bailemos, senores y senoras! Arriba!"
    shu "跳舞吧，女士们先生们！燥起来！（译注：原文为西班牙语。）"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6926
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_9c110d71:

    # k "Oh!"
    k "呀！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6927
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_38c92d62:

    # mc "It takes two to tango, Mamacita. Now sway those hips for me."
    mc "探戈要两个人一起跳，美女。把腿给我扭起来。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6928
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_3d28e372:

    # k "Ah! Okay, okay! Take it easy on me! It's been such a long time!"
    k "啊！行吧，行吧！别这么逼我！都多久没跳过了！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6931
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_5e3fa1de:

    # mc "No pasa nada, Klara. We have all the time in the world."
    mc "没关系的，克拉拉。时间多得是。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6932
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_72b46607:

    # mc "Plus, this will give us time to catch up, don't you think?"
    mc "而且，我们也正好可以借这个机会聊聊，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6935
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_0c09e7f9:

    # k "So this is what you meant in the morning. What did you want to talk about?"
    k "原来你早上的话是这个意思。你想聊什么？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6936
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_46a25222:

    # mc "Well, aside from the fact that you're absolutely killing it and still know how to move your body..."
    mc "嗯，除了你现在依然风姿绰约，很懂该怎么跳舞以外……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6939
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_bf236e69:

    # k "Oh, shut up..."
    k "得了吧你……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6940
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_065730f8:

    # mc "I know this situation with [landlord] has to be weighing on you, even though you're hiding it so well."
    mc "我知道，哪怕你尽力隐瞒，[landlord!t]的事依然让你心神不安。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6943
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_0f131ef4:

    # k "...*sighs*"
    k "…… *叹气*"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6944
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_ab2ea21d:

    # k "Picture this: you're living the life you've always wanted with the man you're convinced is your soulmate."
    k "想象一下吧：你以为自己找到了灵魂伴侣，和他过上了自己一直想要的生活。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6945
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_ccee7f14:

    # k "Then one day, seemingly without any reason, he just disappears without so much as a goodbye or even a note."
    k "然后突然有一天，连什么原因都不知道，他就连招呼都不打一声地消失了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6946
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_1aba77d1:

    # k "As if that wasn't enough... Later, you find out that he murdered two people in cold blood..."
    k "就算这样也还不够……后来，你还发现他残忍地杀掉了两个人……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6947
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_be5283b5:

    # k "Whatever hope you had left of him returning is snuffed out forever, just like the lives he took away..."
    k "心里盼着他会回来的最后那点希望，也变得跟他夺走的生命一样，烟消云散了……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6948
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_c457abf2:

    # mc "And all this time, you had to find the best way to provide for two teenagers on your own..."
    mc "而且一直以来，你还要想尽办法抚养两个小孩长大……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6949
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_2962d229:

    # k "It's... it's been tough... I've wanted to cry but couldn't because I had to stay strong for you and Sky."
    k "真的……很困难……我一直想哭，但为了你和斯凯，我必须坚强。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6950
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_43323211:

    # mc "Well then, let me ask you this: how badly do you want to get this thing done?"
    mc "好吧，我问你一个问题：你到底有多想办成这件事？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6953
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_48d1daff:

    # k "You mean, finding Jovian?"
    k "你是说，找乔维安吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6954
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_5ce09775:

    # mc "Mhm."
    mc "嗯。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6957
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_33dec1f0:

    # k "Honestly, a part of me wishes he was dead so that we wouldn't have to be associated with him anymore."
    k "说实话，我有时候会觉得，他死了反而更好，我们就再也不用和他扯上关系了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6958
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_4e2de212:

    # k "On the other hand, part of me wishes we could find him alive."
    k "但同时，我也希望他还活着，我们能找到他。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6959
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_0e9013c7:

    # mc "Why is that?"
    mc "为什么？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6960
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_18d6b05f:

    # k "So we can finally get some answers and know if he still has any part of the man he once was inside of him..."
    k "这样我们就终于可以知道答案了。也可以知道，以前的他到底还在不在……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6961
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_2bf1f785:

    # k "Either way, I know that discovering his whereabouts is the only way to bring closure to this situation."
    k "不管怎样，我知道，只有找到他才能解决这一切。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6964
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_0a293df7:

    # mc "So, you want to hunt him down, either way?"
    mc "所以，不管怎么样，你都想找到他？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6965
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_fb0f05f6:

    # k "Yes. I know you'll be leading the effort because I have to focus on building businesses to tackle the other side of this story..."
    k "是的。我知道这方面会由你来负责，因为我还要把精力集中在创办公司，好完成故事的另一半上面……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6966
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_a31f0f05:

    # k "But I promise to support you in any way I can. This is my oath to you as your [landlady]."
    k "但我保证，我会尽我所能帮你的。我以你[landlady!t]的身份发誓。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6969
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_cad99dbc:

    # mc "Thank you for that. But speaking of our relationship..."
    mc "谢谢你。但说到我们的关系……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6970
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_0d8324f2:

    # yt "Still flexible at her age. Pretty impressive."
    yt "这个年纪还这么灵活。厉害啊。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6973
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_625997f0:

    # mc "I understand you have reasons for doing what you did, don't get me wrong. I respect you as my [landlady] too much to believe anything else."
    mc "我理解，你的作为都是有原因的，别误会我。你是我[landlady!t]，我很尊重你，不会有其他的想法。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6974
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_716fb8ea:

    # mc "At the same time, that was an extremely high-risk gamble to have me find out about the girls and [landlord]."
    mc "但同时，你这种让我知道[landlord!t]和这些姑娘们的事的方法，真是个风险极高的赌博。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6975
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_a773cad9:

    # k "I'm fully aware of that."
    k "我非常清楚。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6976
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_a2cd381e:

    # k "However, that was the only method I could think of that would allow you to understand the scope of the situation fully."
    k "但是，要想让你了解到事情的全貌，这是我唯一能想到的办法了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6979
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_96a86eaf:

    # mc "Thankfully, it paid off."
    mc "还好，最后事情很顺利。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6980
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_34d7f784:

    # mc "But what if Hera sent a car to intercept and run us down?"
    mc "但要是赫拉派了辆车拦住我们，把我们都干掉了呢？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6981
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_c8c82725:

    # mc "What if either Moon or Claire took one wrong step and were suppressed by Hera's men?"
    mc "要是月或者克莱尔出了差错，被赫拉的手下放倒了呢？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6982
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_184e4512:

    # mc "What if Hera decided to take out her revenge on either Aine or myself, consequences be damned?"
    mc "要是赫拉决定不顾一切后果地报复我或者艾妮呢？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6983
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_46129009:

    # mc "If even one link in the chain had broken, we could have gotten seriously hurt. Or even worse, ended up dead."
    mc "哪怕链条上的任意一环出了差错，我们都会有很大的危险。或者更糟糕，可能会死掉。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6984
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_93fe9029:

    # mc "I don't mean to lecture you. I can handle it if it's a gamble with just my life on the line."
    mc "我不是想教训你。如果只牵扯到我一个人的命，我怎么赌都无所谓。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6985
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_2494310c:

    # mc "That said, you have to promise me one thing."
    mc "所以，你必须跟我保证一件事。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6986
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_224eeec0:

    # k "What is it?"
    k "什么事？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6987
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_6515a497:

    # mc "Promise me that if there are any risky plans that involve more than just me, you won't pursue them and will look for other options."
    mc "跟我保证，如果又有了什么有风险的计划，其中牵扯到不止我一个人，那你绝对不能执行，要想别的办法。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6988
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_0eacb74d:

    # mc "Especially if they involve you."
    mc "特别是如果牵扯到你就更不行了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6991
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_c49c4de0:

    # k "...I'm sorry, [mc], but I'm not sure if I can promise that."
    k "……对不起，[mc!t]，但我没法保证这种事。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6992
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_27674f87:

    # k "You can't just play things safe all the time and expect to come out on top."
    k "要想把事情办好，不可能一直没有风险的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6995
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_595f3185:

    # k "However, I promise I will let you know what I'm thinking from now on."
    k "但是，我保证我以后会把我的想法都告诉你。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6996
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_bc094ded:

    # mc "That's good enough for me."
    mc "这就足够了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:6997
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_e78e7a55:

    # mc "Anyway, enough dark and gloomy talk for now. Why don't you dust off those skills and take the lead for this next part?"
    mc "总之，阴沉黑暗的话题聊得够多了。接下来换你主导，让你秀一下技术吧？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7000
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_5ad05b3b:

    # k "How about you stay as the lead and use what I taught you?"
    k "要不你继续带头，把我教你的本事都用出来？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7001
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_1a999ce5:

    # mc "It's been long since we last danced together, you know?"
    mc "我们上次一起跳舞都有多久了啊？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7002
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_ff0e0679:

    # mc "How old was I? Sixteen?"
    mc "我那时候几岁啊？16？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7003
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_e7bb348c:

    # k "You were fourteen."
    k "14岁。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7006
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_d0a4d0b5:

    # mc "That long ago..."
    mc "那么久了……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7009
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_552fd8df:

    # k "Yes. Don't tell me you've forgotten everything because of all these girls around you?"
    k "是啊。可别告诉我，现在身边全是漂亮姑娘了，就把我教你的东西忘完了？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7010
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_1f77f692:

    # k "Oh, you're making [landlady] sad."
    k "你可是会让[landlady!t]很伤心的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7011
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_b538ec88:

    # mc "Come on, [landlady]. Stop talking like I'm still ten years old or something."
    mc "拜托，[landlady!t]。别把我当小孩了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7012
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_54ce657a:

    # k "You can handle it. You're my [tenant], after all."
    k "你可以的。毕竟你是我[tenant!t]。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7013
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_d3f983a2:

    # mc "I'll just wing it, then. Let's see what comes naturally."
    mc "那我就随意发挥了。看看即兴出来的舞步是什么样的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7014
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_220ccd51:

    # mc "Ready for the grand finale?"
    mc "准备好华丽谢幕了吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7015
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_06288264:

    # k "Let's do it."
    k "来吧。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7028
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_9546ae7f:

    # mc "Hold this for me."
    mc "替我保管好这个。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7029
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_0ff4de12:

    # k "Oh my god, [mc]. What is this?"
    k "我的天啊，[mc!t]。这什么啊？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7030
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_f73c52d8:

    # mc "Now do our usual finish."
    mc "现在做往常的那个收尾。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7031
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_ed018061:

    # k "Now?"
    k "现在？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7032
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_d01691f9:

    # mc "Yeah, now! Don't forget to smile!"
    mc "对，现在！别忘了微笑！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7036
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_937e1d5e:

    # ev "*clapping*"
    ev "*鼓掌*"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7045
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_54805615:

    # k "{i}Ohh!"
    k "{i}哦！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7049
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_d0054151:

    # mc "Hup! Up you go!"
    mc "哈！起来吧！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7050
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_2ea51022:

    # g "Yow, nice moves, both of you!"
    g "哎呦，二位，可以啊！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7051
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_d0d44c99:

    # mc "Damn! That was intense! It looks like you haven't lost a step at all, Miss \"I'm too old for this\"."
    mc "我去！可真不简单啊！看来你一步也没跳错啊，\"太老跳不动\"小姐。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7054
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_f2475cdb:

    # k "Feeling extra cheeky today, aren't you? I didn't teach you that rose thingy, and I certainly didn't teach you that last part."
    k "今天皮上瘾了是吧？我可没教过你什么玫瑰，最后那一部分当然也没教过你。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7057
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_8e11314d:

    # mc "Heh, sorry... had to make sure we ended {b}smooth{/b}."
    mc "哈，抱歉……得让这支舞结束得{b}顺滑{/b}一点嘛。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7060
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_7979e1b6:

    # k "Hmph! That's enough out of you. Now, this old lady has to rest her bones."
    k "哼！你也闹够了吧。现在，这位老太婆得去歇歇她的老骨头了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7061
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_a6f40629:

    # k "But that was fun, [mc]. Thank you for that. I didn’t know how much I needed it."
    k "不过刚才很有意思，[mc!t]。谢谢你。让我轻松了不少。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7062
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_6c748e3c:

    # mc "The pleasure was all mine, milady."
    mc "我的荣幸，小姐。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7063
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_ae3958e5:

    # mc "...And welcome home."
    mc "……还有，欢迎回家。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7069
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_0f240219:

    # mc "If you say so..."
    mc "那就听你的吧……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7070
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_4e22d268:

    # k "Trust me, I'm fine. I'm content to sit by the warm fire and relax these old bones."
    k "我没事的，相信我。我这把老骨头，只要能在火堆旁边休息一下就行了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7071
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_8789481c:

    # mc "Old? Come on. It's not like you're a grandma!"
    mc "老？什么呀。说得好像你已经是个老奶奶了一样！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7072
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_ed1c9611:

    # k "*chuckles* Maybe not, but I haven't had a chance to sit down and process everything for a long time."
    k "*笑* 确实不是，但我已经很久没有能静静坐下来，把事情好好消化一下的机会了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7073
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_d9c08b49:

    # k "I should take advantage of this moment while I can."
    k "我觉得正好可以趁现在这个机会好好想想。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7074
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_c075fd6a:

    # mc "Alright, let me know if you want to talk any time. I'm always willing to listen."
    mc "好吧，如果你想聊聊，随时可以来找我。我洗耳恭听。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7075
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_18a80854:

    # k "Thank you, [tenant]. But please, don't let me stop you from joining your girlfriends."
    k "谢谢你，[tenant!t]。但是，请别因为我就不去跟你的女朋友们一起了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7076
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_cee5cb32:

    # mc "Nahh! I'll just chill here with you."
    mc "哪儿的话！我就在这陪着你吧。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7084
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_b5838c6f:

    # "Three hours later..."
    "三个小时之后……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7095
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_3b21f354:

    # mc "......"
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7096
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_c90f040d:

    # yt "Yeah, I expected that, but is she really this weak with alcohol?"
    yt "这场景我确实料到了，但她真的这么不能喝酒吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7097
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_bb156b5f:

    # yt "She's easily seasick, flustered fast, and gets drunk easily... Probably a cheapskate too..."
    yt "她晕船晕得厉害，很快就会被惹急，也特别容易喝醉……可能还是个守财奴……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7098
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_b62c51a0:

    # yt "Damn..."
    yt "天啊……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7101
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_1cb416bf:

    # yt "Then the one I expected to get drunk first is..."
    yt "然后，我想着会第一个喝醉的人是……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7105
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_160ecd43:

    # g "Wait... You didn't tell me about this!"
    g "等一下啊……你没跟我说过这个！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7106
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_d03fbfad:

    # g "So you attacked that old hag on the second day of class?!"
    g "所以你开学第二天就跑去打那个老太婆了？！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7107
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_e588e3f8:

    # g "Tell me more! What happened?! Did you at least leave a scar on her face or something?!"
    g "再多说点！后来怎么样了？！你至少也得在她脸上留个疤之类的吧？！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7110
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_1b9d9fa9:

    # e "Uh... no. She caught my foot just as it was about to land."
    e "呃……没有。我那一脚还没踢到，就被她抓住了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7111
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_63f90c24:

    # g "What a waste..."
    g "真可惜……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7112
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_9505a6af:

    # g "You should've pushed it more! Better to just dispose of her from the start!"
    g "你应该再狠点的！最好从一开始就把她给解决掉！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7113
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_5a2149e9:

    # e "I'm not that kind of person. Also..."
    e "我不是那种人。而且……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7116
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_3f7bd801:

    # e "She may be sleeping, but who knows if she might hear you?"
    e "她可能是睡着了，但要是她听见了怎么办？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7117
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_30642ab1:

    # g "Oh, fu-"
    g "我ca——"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7118
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_d921925a:

    # g "I'm sorry."
    g "不好意思。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7121
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_5e2bc81e:

    # g "What you told her earlier during the discussion... Was that true?"
    g "之前，在讨论的时候你跟她说的事……是真的吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7122
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_3b21f354_1:

    # mc "......"
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7125
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_374eece6:

    # mc "It's nothing but a hypothesis combined with intuition if that makes sense."
    mc "只不过是假设而已。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7126
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_2c5f5fa2:

    # mc "But... I know there's more to this than what we know, and..."
    mc "但是……我知道肯定还有什么我们不知道的隐情，而且……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7129
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_83549df3:

    # mc "There's a huge chance that it revolves around her."
    mc "很大几率是跟她有关的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7130
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_b2c15cd7:

    # mc "Although, I did not expect her reaction earlier."
    mc "不过，我没想到她之前会是那种反应。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7133
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_cbf22570:

    # e "We all know what Hera is, but in the end, she is still her mother."
    e "我们都知道赫拉是个什么货色，但说到底，她俩终究还是母女。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7134
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_d95cc030:

    # e "Hearing what you said might have stirred what little compassion Aine has left for Hera."
    e "你说的话可能激起了艾妮对赫拉的最后一点感情。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7135
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_fd9c65a4:

    # mc "I guessed as much..."
    mc "我也想着是这样……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7138
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_ad44a8c2:

    # e "Are you fine with delaying the investigation like this, though?"
    e "不过，推迟调查真的没问题吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7139
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_cb46f552:

    # e "I wanted to document the information as soon as I went back on duty, but this vacation suddenly came out of nowhere."
    e "我本来打算一回去上班就着手开始，但你却突然让我们来这里度假。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7140
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_62926a08:

    # mc "What happened the past few days was too much to bear. A one-day rest is fine, I suppose."
    mc "过去几天发生的事实在太沉重了。我觉得休息一天也好。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7141
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_380f973e:

    # e "If you think it's a good decision, I'm with you. I'll update you as soon as I find any leads on your [landlord]."
    e "只要是你的决定，我都赞成。我找到你[landlord!t]的新线索之后，会立马通知你的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7142
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_33635a1a:

    # mc "Thanks, Em. Please do."
    mc "谢谢，小艾。请务必这样。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7145
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_8d1eb55b:

    # f "Hey, hey! Did you know that this guy knows aunt Jess?"
    f "哎哎！你们知道这小子认识婕斯姨妈吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7146
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_8ba1fcaf:

    # mc "I'm sorry?"
    mc "你说什么？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7148
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_eaef6c6c:

    # f "Whoa, what happened to her?"
    f "哇，她怎么了？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7149
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_ccddff5a:

    # mc "Exactly how you see it."
    mc "相信你看得出来。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7150
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_e7ca3b85:

    # shu "Well, Jess did confirm that when we called her, didn't she?"
    shu "婕斯在我们给她打电话的时候已经确认过这点了，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7153
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_bfbca0f8:

    # f "I know, I'm asking [mc] here."
    f "我知道，我是在问[mc!t]。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7154
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_178aca12:

    # mc "That's news to me. How does Jess know some run-of-the-mill dude like him?"
    mc "这我还是第一次听说。婕斯怎么会认识这么一个没来头的小屁孩？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7157
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_8f968c26:

    # shu "Do you really consider me an unremarkable guy?"
    shu "你不会真以为我是个没背景没能力的普通人吧？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7158
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_206e1b61:

    # mc "Well... No?"
    mc "呃……对啊？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7161
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_0a9c6a23:

    # shu "Don't say it like a damn question!"
    shu "我这是反问句！！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7164
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_6ccb7fd0:

    # shu "I can probably disclose it now that all their problems are over. But to make it safe, my family and I are part of Jess'..."
    shu "既然他们的事情都已经解决完了，我说出来应该也没关系。但安全一点的说法是，我的家庭和我算是婕斯的……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7165
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_2378b6a3:

    # shu "How do I put this...?"
    shu "我该怎么形容呢……？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7166
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_bac0a716:

    # shu "Let's just say, {b}power{/b}."
    shu "这么说吧，在她的{b}势力范围{/b}之内。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7169
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_b3f95627:

    # shu "You see my accessories? They all came from her. She sent these to me as a gift."
    shu "看见我的首饰了吗？全都是她的。她当做礼物送给我的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7172
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_2de79119:

    # mc "Huh... Now that you mention it, you both have the same accessories."
    mc "哈……你这么一说，你俩戴的首饰确实是一样的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7173
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_823cde05:

    # mc "Wait, so then you're part of-"
    mc "等等，这么说，你也是——"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7174
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_2e410ba4:

    # shu "Oh, nahh..."
    shu "哦，不不不……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7175
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_236358f4:

    # shu "I did support their cause from the sidelines in return for something I needed, but I was never part of them. Me and my family, I mean."
    shu "我确实会在旁支持他们的事业，也收取我需要的报酬，但我和我的家人从来都不是他们的成员。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7176
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_9a5d6842:

    # mc "How come you never brought that up with me?"
    mc "你怎么从来没跟我提过？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7177
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_f153373c:

    # shu "Well, dude, I was overseas. We barely contacted each other that whole time."
    shu "我在国外啊，兄弟。这几年来我们都没怎么联系过。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7180
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_5c18ecf5:

    # shu "Not only that, but we're also forbidden to disclose any information regarding their club, clan, or whatever."
    shu "不仅如此，我们还被禁止向外透露有关他们的这个俱乐部，还是氏族，随便什么叫法，的任何信息。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7181
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_0e62f6e8:

    # shu "I was only introduced to them when I went overseas, though. After my aunt asked me for help."
    shu "我是在出国以后才认识他们的。具体来说，是在我的姨妈来找我帮忙之后。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7182
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_4138dfe1:

    # mc "Your aunt?"
    mc "你的姨妈？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7183
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_856db2d0:

    # mc "Also, can you remove that mustache? I find it very disturbing..."
    mc "还有，能把你那假胡子摘掉吗？我看了犯恶心……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7184
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_85cc166d:

    # shu "Ah, yeah! You don't know her?"
    shu "对啊！你不认识她？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7185
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_9b5c26fd:

    # shu "She's one of Jess' closest friends and owner of one of the biggest companies in this city: {b}Aurora Hanson{/b}."
    shu "她是婕斯最亲近的好朋友之一，也是城里的大公司的老板：{b}奥罗拉·汉森{/b}。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7186
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_e354e005:

    # mc "You serious?! I've seen her in TV shows before!"
    mc "你认真的？！我以前在电视里看见过她！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7187
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_3c055eef:

    # shu "Yep! Isn't she a goddess?"
    shu "对！她特别漂亮吧？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7188
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_4712f24c:

    # mc "So... You knew about me this whole time?"
    mc "所以……你一直以来都知道我的事？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7189
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_0f6da8e3:

    # shu "Eh, no... I had no idea who the hell you were. Jess never mentioned anything about you, that's why I was surprised this morning."
    shu "呃，不是的……我根本不知道你到底有什么背景。婕斯从来没提过有关你的事，所以我早上才那么惊讶。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7192
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_bc8ce5d3:

    # shu "Anyway, we're not here to talk about me and the minorities."
    shu "总之，我们还是别谈这些小事了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7193
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_c4920d54:

    # shu "Freya and I need your help."
    shu "芙蕾雅和我需要你的帮助。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7194
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_0a7064c9:

    # f "*nods* Mhm, mhm!"
    f "*点头* 嗯嗯！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7195
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_64dc4163:

    # mc "Oh, right. What do you need me for?"
    mc "哦，对。需要我做什么呢？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7196
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_bce24a3e:

    # shu "Sky already told you most of it, but we need your help in convincing your neighbor."
    shu "斯凯已经把大部分东西都告诉你了，不过我们需要你帮忙说服你的邻居。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7197
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_2adb4d59:

    # shu "You get what I'm saying?"
    shu "听懂我的意思了没？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7198
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_bd2d5ef9:

    # mc "Well, I'm catching up, at least."
    mc "至少我在听。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7199
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_a774b7a7:

    # mc "But why me? You're a businessman. I just flip burgers on a daily basis."
    mc "但为什么找我？你是生意人。我只是个卖汉堡的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7200
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_640c771c:

    # shu "You're selling yourself too short, dude! You're a smooth talker! You always finessed your way through stuff back in college, so I know you can do it!"
    shu "别谦虚了，伙计！你很会说话的！大学的时候你总是巧舌如簧，所以我知道你肯定可以的！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7201
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_e4c5e405:

    # shu "Plus, I just recently moved in, so you know them better than me."
    shu "再说了，我才刚刚搬来，所以你跟他们更熟。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7204
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_6b0fcfcf:

    # g "I don't know what you guys want to achieve, but I agree with him."
    g "我不知道你们要干嘛，不过我同意他说的话。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7205
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_92f16cc0:

    # e "Yeah."
    e "是啊。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7206
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_5876d0ad:

    # shu "See?"
    shu "听见没？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7207
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_072b53d7:

    # f "Is he?"
    f "他真这么厉害？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7210
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_ec371f6a:

    # mc "Okay, okay! Let me get this straight..."
    mc "好吧，好吧！让我把话说清楚……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7211
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_7b83b18f:

    # mc "First, I'm no smooth talker."
    mc "首先，我根本没有什么巧舌如簧的本事。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7212
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_0164b86b:

    # mc "Second, I make no promises, but I'll try it. It's better for us to stay close to each other, anyway."
    mc "其次，我没法保证，但我会试试的。反正我们住得近点总归没有坏处。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7213
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_29bbee2c:

    # shu "Sounds good to me~!"
    shu "那就好~！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7214
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_903b659f:

    # f "Do you think we should ask Moon to move in with me, too?"
    f "你们说，要让月和我一起搬过来吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7217
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_8fea2db2:

    # mc "Hmm..."
    mc "嗯……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7218
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_6c5d5429:

    # mc "If we think about it, that would be great for us if she could, but..."
    mc "考虑一下的话，她要是能过来肯定是件好事，但是……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7225
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_423b236c:

    # mc "Considering that she has a responsibility back in her place, I doubt that she will-"
    mc "她还有那个地方需要照顾，我觉得她不会——"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7229
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_f97d6b9a:

    # m "I'll go."
    m "我愿意。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7230
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_2daf05ed:

    # mc "Whoa! Where the hell did you come from?!"
    mc "我天！你是从哪冒出来的？！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7231
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_32a7242c:

    # m "From the roof."
    m "屋顶。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7232
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_375637ff:

    # mc "From the roof?! Did you just jump down?"
    mc "屋顶？！你跳下来的？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7233
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_1dbbfbd1:

    # m "Yeah."
    m "对。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7236
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_9bfffe3b:

    # mc "A-anyway, are you sure?"
    mc "总-总之，你确定吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7237
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_b7c86a46:

    # m "Yeah, I'll go. If you need me, all you have to do is to tell me."
    m "是啊，我愿意。你需要我的话，告诉我一声就好了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7238
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_362ac0f4:

    # mc "That place is important to you, isn't it?"
    mc "但那个地方对你来说不是很重要吗？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7239
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_58792685:

    # m "I can leave the place to Owl, simple as that. I have a new priority now."
    m "我可以把那里交给枭，就这么简单。我现在有更要紧的事。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7242
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_3b21f354_2:

    # mc "......"
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7245
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_939560b6:

    # mc "Alright, then. That's settled."
    mc "好吧。那就这么定了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7246
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_63419b8b:

    # e "*yawns*"
    e "*打哈欠*"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7247
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_9ff7c567:

    # mc "What time do we need to leave tomorrow?"
    mc "我们明天要什么时候走？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7250
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_ded82b80:

    # shu "The first booker did not cancel their reservation but moved it to the next day. So we have to check out early in the morning."
    shu "我们之前预定的客人其实没有取消预定，而是移到了明天。所以我们一大早就得走了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7251
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_a7bcf340:

    # mc "I see..."
    mc "我明白了……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7254
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_12457d74:

    # mc "Well, why don't we call it a night? It's getting late."
    mc "那要不就去睡觉吧？时候不早了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7255
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_552783c5:

    # g "Yeah. I love this place, but I'm not so comfortable staying up late and getting drunk here for some reason."
    g "是啊。我喜欢这个地方，但不知道为什么，我也不太想在这里又熬夜又喝醉的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7256
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_04e4c6d8:

    # mc "Let me just..."
    mc "看我给她……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7259
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_45afd08f:

    # mc "Hup!"
    mc "起！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7263
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_e280253d:

    # a "Mmmh!"
    a "嗯嗯！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7264
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_e11b59d4:

    # mc "I'm carrying you to bed, don't complain!"
    mc "我是带你上床睡觉呢，不许抱怨！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7267
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_9ac3cdf6:

    # e "You'll have to get used to that as soon as possible."
    e "你得尽快习惯她这样了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7268
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_49903898:

    # g "Yeah, goodluck adjusting to her!"
    g "是啊，祝你好运！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7269
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_24b25b0f:

    # mc "*sighs*"
    mc "*叹气*"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7284
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_a1e7e975:

    # mc "Huh... I didn't notice her. How long has she been sleeping?"
    mc "啊……我都没注意到她。她睡过去多久了？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7285
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_71ff6a45:

    # s "About an hour. She must have been exhausted."
    s "差不多一个小时了。肯定是累坏了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7286
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_cf88f6fd:

    # mc "I can't blame her."
    mc "也正常。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7287
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_11c2be2c:

    # mc "How about you? You should've slept with her."
    mc "你呢？你应该和她一起睡的吧。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7288
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_ea223d4e:

    # s "I was sorting out my lesson plan for for the kids' final exam."
    s "期末考试快到了，我在给学生们制定课程计划。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7289
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_fde86dbb:

    # mc "Oh? Using your mobile?"
    mc "哦？用手机？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7290
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_94885683:

    # s "Yeah, I got this app that links on both PC and mobile through a cloud storage so I can access my files anytime."
    s "是啊，我装的app能把手机和电脑同时连接到云端，所以可以随时访问我的文件。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7291
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_122633a6:

    # mc "Okay, that's pretty convenient."
    mc "好吧，还挺方便的。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7295
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_a1ed3948:

    # mc "There."
    mc "好了。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7298
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_d8cd0958:

    # s "Was she really that drunk?"
    s "她醉这么厉害？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7299
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_fecf81a8:

    # mc "Yeah. Gwen is usually the one to typically go down first, but..."
    mc "是啊。一般来说，格温是最先喝倒的那个，不过……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7302
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_8c817077:

    # g "Uh, [mc]...?"
    g "呃，[mc!t]……？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7305
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_191559e1:

    # mc "What's up?"
    mc "怎么了？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7306
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_2010d749:

    # g "They don't have any extra bed or futon..."
    g "床不够了……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7307
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_a056611e:

    # mc "Ah, shit..."
    mc "啊，操……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7308
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_a29f681e:

    # mc "Well? There are only four beds, so three of us will have to share a bed."
    mc "那就只有四张床了。有三个人要挤一张床。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7310
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_ce7f0fb1:

    # g "I vote for the short stacks!"
    g "我建议让小矮子们睡一起！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7311
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_468b13d9_1:

    # shu "......"
    shu "……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7312
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_39daf8a0:

    # f "......"
    f "……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7315
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_66593509:

    # g "What? Got something to say...?"
    g "怎么？你们有意见是吧……？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7316
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_4ab450e6:

    # shu "N-nothing!" (multiple=2)
    shu "没-没有！" (multiple=2)

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7317
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_1f807a41:

    # f "Nothing!" (multiple=2)
    f "没有！" (multiple=2)

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7318
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_36a70fdd:

    # g "Good!"
    g "很好！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7322
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_f872d4aa:

    # shu "Hmp! I'll never share a bed with girls, except for my girlfriends. It's against my Shu Code."
    shu "哼！除了我的女朋友之外，我不可能跟女人睡一张床的。有违我的原则。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7323
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_f1c3efdf:

    # mc "No one forced you to."
    mc "也没人逼你啊。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7326
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_6e7bd474:

    # s "I'll share!"
    s "我愿意！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7329
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_f5374c05:

    # m "I'll sleep with her, then."
    m "那我就跟她一起睡吧。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7332
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_e9d90a3c:

    # f "Me too!"
    f "我也来！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7357
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_c8b911f9:

    # "Two hours later..."
    "两个小时之后……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7367
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_3b21f354_3:

    # mc "......"
    mc "……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7368
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_0a0b62d1:

    # mc ".........."
    mc "…………"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7369
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_f2addb9e:

    # yt "T-this voice..."
    yt "这-这个声音……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7373
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_e55b9a70:

    # yt "......"
    yt "……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7374
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_08b9b43c:

    # yt "Huh? Why am I..."
    yt "啊？为什么我……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7375
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_96a2cda6:

    # yt "...Tearing up?"
    yt "……流泪了？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7387
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_7107ff2c:

    # yt "Right..."
    yt "对了……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7388
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_c40b37a4:

    # yt "This is the song she sang to me when..."
    yt "这首歌，是那时候她唱给我的……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7394
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_d4cd1255:

    # yt "How the hell... could I forget about it...?"
    yt "我怎么……能忘掉呢……？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7397
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_e55b9a70_1:

    # yt "......"
    yt "……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7401
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_1e732092:

    # yt "That's right... I had her when I had nothing else. She was the only one who stayed by my side no matter what happened."
    yt "是啊……我一无所有的时候，只有她在。只有她，不管发生什么，都陪在我身边。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7405
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_cb126477:

    # s "......"
    s "……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7409
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_f6adceb2:

    # s "I hoped that it would somehow wake you up."
    s "我正希望能把你唱醒呢。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7413
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_d039bd9f:

    # s "*giggles* You were crying, right?"
    s "*笑* 你哭了，对吧？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7414
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_e03e0da9:

    # mc "H-huh? No, I wasn't."
    mc "什-什么？没有。"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7415
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_b52244a8:

    # s "Hmn...! But I saw your eyes~! You can't just deny it!"
    s "哼……！我都看见你的眼睛了~！你否认不了！"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7416
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_7be6128a:

    # mc "*sighs* Yeah... I did... A little bit..."
    mc "*叹气* 好吧……是哭了……不过只有一小下……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7417
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_2ad25eb1:

    # mc "What can I say? That's one way to bring back memories, and your voice is just..."
    mc "没办法呀。让我想起了过去的事情，还有你的声音，很……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7418
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_8f456e93:

    # s "Oh, you've complimented me enough for today. Can we just take our time and enjoy this scenery?"
    s "噢，你今天夸我已经夸得够多了。我们还是欣赏一下眼前的景色吧？"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7419
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_664e963d:

    # mc "You're just staring at a black sea, though..."
    mc "但你只是在盯着漆黑的海面看啊……"

# game/ch1ep1.rpy:7422
translate chinese moonlightskinnydip_1331ed28:

    # s "No matter how small or ugly things are, anything is better when I'm with you. It always has been. So, don't let me go, [mc]."
